(text "5 mOhm, not the data sheet's 10: the boost can draw over 7 A from the pack and 10 mOhm measures only to 5.1 A." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 300.99 190.5 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "0d41bbe2-15fb-5bb9-92ff-40aa6a792a62"))
(text "RT51 is a board thermistor for the gauge; the pack's own NTC goes to the charger only (two bias networks" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 300.99 194.31 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "a98055d6-e717-5538-89d1-cf8bdc15cc76"))
(text "cannot share one thermistor). U51 and BT1 have no footprint yet: see the README." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 300.99 198.12 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "1bf8f876-f446-5b13-a82d-11d62f7dc243"))
